msgctxt "80"
msgid "You... You did it! You actually won! Yesss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Whew... Not bad at all. I ain't played a solid game like\r\n"
"that in years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"You have no idea how grateful I am... Now I can keep my bar\r\n"
"open! Oh, this is fantastic!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"What about the money he owes the casino? Do you just pay\r\n"
"for it out of your own pocket?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Sure do. I got plenty tucked away, so money ain't no thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"It's just that, at my age, I like havin' a front-row seat\r\n"
"when people suddenly gotta play for keeps. It's either the\r\n"
"desperation or determination that spices things up for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "You really do have a crooked way of thinking..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Hah, I suppose you're right. But get to be my age, and\r\n"
"you'll see what I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't count on it... Oh, and just out of curiosity,\r\n"
"what would you have done if I had lost?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Heh. Mighty fine question you asked there.\r\n"
"I'd probably get the deed, take over the bar,\r\n"
"and put this guy to work as the manager."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "That's what you were planning to do all along?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Well, for a sap who gambles all day and night, it takes a\r\n"
"hard lesson to smack some sense into ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I get it. He saves up a bit of cash, and you give him back\r\n"
"the deed... Is that how it goes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Now, now... It just wouldn't do for me to give away all my\r\n"
"secrets, would it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"But listen, it was a great game. I wouldn't mind givin'\r\n"
"you a real match one of these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Then I'll be waiting for that day to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Hah. Well. See you around, young man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"You don't know how much this means to me... I'll never\r\n"
"gamble again, I swear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Here... I promised you a reward. I know it's not much, but\r\n"
"it's the best I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>100.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "320"
msgid "See you later. I've gotta go tell my wife the good news!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "You... You lost? Oh no... My life is over now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"That's too bad. But a deal is a deal... and that means\r\n"
"the deed is mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Waugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Hey, don't worry. You can stay on as an employee."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"The bar's just changin' owners. Everything else'll stay\r\n"
"the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cosa...?"

msgctxt "488"
msgid "So that was what you were planning to do all along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"I guess you could say that. People who aren't used to\r\n"
"gambling tend to lose themselves in the game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"I just wanna give 'em the opportunity to find themselves\r\n"
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "So you mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"I mean, if you work hard and save up some money, I'll give\r\n"
"you back the deed⑬with a teeny bit of interest, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Oh, thank you so much! I'm so grateful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Heh. Maybe you're not so crooked after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"You know, I wouldn't mind takin' you on in a real match one\r\n"
"of these days. Just make sure you get a little practice\r\n"
"before then, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Deal. But I won't lose so easily next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Hah. Perhaps we shall see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

